# Deny by default; nothing is tracked unless a rule below names it.
#
# The usual shape of this file is the opposite -- list the junk, let everything
# else through -- and that shape has two failures this one does not. A new kind
# of file matches no rule and is one reflexive `git add` from the history. And
# the deny list is itself published: every path it names announces that such a
# file exists in the working tree, so excluding `PERSONAL.md` by name still
# tells a reader there is a `PERSONAL.md`.
#
# Inverted, a file nobody named does not get committed, and this file describes
# only what ships.
#
# The keep list names FILES, not extensions. A `!/**/*.md` rule would be
# shorter and would re-admit any note dropped at the root, `PERSONAL.md`
# included, or into a directory this file re-opens, though Markdown
# legitimately lives only in the repository root, `.github/` and
# `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/`.
#
# Git will not look inside a directory it has ignored, so each directory below
# is re-opened before its files are named back.

*


# ─── root ───
!/.gitignore
!/.pylintrc
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/pyproject.toml
!/pyrightconfig.json
!/requirements-build.txt
!/requirements-dev.txt
!/requirements-test.txt
!/run_tests.py
!/setup.cfg

# ─── .github/workflows ───
!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/issue.md
!/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md
!/.github/comment-share.json
!/.github/dependabot.yml
!/.github/size-baseline.json
!/.github/scripts/
!/.github/scripts/commit_scopes.py
!/.github/scripts/conflict_markers.sh
!/.github/scripts/gate_base_freshness.py
!/.github/scripts/publish_release.sh
!/.github/scripts/test_commit_scopes.py
!/.github/scripts/test_conflict_markers.py
!/.github/scripts/test_gate_base_freshness.py
!/.github/scripts/test_publish_release.py
!/.github/workflows/actionlint.yml
!/.github/workflows/audit.yml
!/.github/workflows/claim.yml
!/.github/workflows/codeql.yml
!/.github/workflows/comment-share.yml
!/.github/workflows/lint.yml
!/.github/workflows/pin-guard.yml
!/.github/workflows/pr-gate.yml
!/.github/workflows/release.yml
!/.github/workflows/scorecard.yml
!/.github/workflows/secrets.yml
!/.github/workflows/size-baseline.yml
!/.github/workflows/tag.yml
!/.github/workflows/tests.yml
!/.github/workflows/types.yml

# ─── git_coauthorship ───
!/git_coauthorship/
!/git_coauthorship/__init__.py
!/git_coauthorship/_scope.py
!/git_coauthorship/author_stats.py
!/git_coauthorship/reauthor.py

# ─── tests ───
!/tests/
!/tests/_util.py
!/tests/test_author_stats.py
!/tests/test_package_contract.py
!/tests/test_reauthor.py
